#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/parrot.md:0
msgid ""
"Learn how to install snap on versions of Parrot Security OS older than 4.1; "
"later releases already include snap by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/parrot.md:8
msgid "Install snap on Parrot Security OS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/parrot.md:10
msgid ""
"If you're running [Parrot Security OS 4.1](https://www.parrotsec.org/) and "
"above, you don't need to do anything. Snap is already installed and ready to "
"go."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/parrot.md:12
msgid ""
"On older versions of Parrot OS, snap can be installed from the command line "
"(and the *Synaptic Package Manager*). Launch the terminal from the top "
"toolbar and enter the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/parrot.md:14
msgid ""
"sudo apt update\n"
"sudo apt install snapd\n"
msgstr ""
